(7426838, 1172550, 63398, '<td valign="top">The construct of this is really special, Lev. I didn''t at first notice that the two people were both sides of the coin. I gave this a 7 just because I liked it on the way through but it wasn''t ''til later I noticed his focus versus her daydreaming. Highly under-rated.</td>', 'The construct of this is really special, Lev. I didn''t at first notice that the two people were both sides of the coin. I gave this a 7 just because I liked it on the way through but it wasn''t ''til later I noticed his focus versus her daydreaming. Highly under-rated.', '2016-01-10 11:04:24.000000', NULL, 0),
